{
  "version": 1,
  "cells": [
    {
      "kind": "markup",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "# Hello, Compiler Notebook\n\nA **buildspec cell** (the `toml` cell below) opens a project and configures it.\nEvery source cell under it belongs to that project, until the next buildspec\ncell. Running any cell of a project builds the whole project, and the output\nlands on the buildspec cell."
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "toml",
      "value": "compiler = \"g++\"\nflags    = [\"-std=c++20\", \"-O2\", \"-Wall\", \"-Wextra\"]\nmode     = \"run\"\noutput   = \"hello\"\n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": "#pragma once\n\n#include <string>\n\ninline std::string greeting() {\n    return \"hello from a compiler notebook v0.0.1\";\n}\n",
      "metadata": {
        "role": "file",
        "filename": "greeting.hpp"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "markup",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "Prose in the middle of a project is fine — Markdown cells never end a project."
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": "#include <iostream>\n\n#include \"greeting.hpp\"\n\nint main() {\n    std::cout << greeting() << '\\n';\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "metadata": {
        "role": "file",
        "filename": "main.cpp"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "markup",
      "language": "markdown",
      "value": "## A second, independent project\n\nThe buildspec cell below starts a new project. It builds in its own temp dir\nwith its own flags, and its `main.cpp` does not collide with the one above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "toml",
      "value": "# Every key is optional: compiler and flags default from the cell language.\nmode = \"build\"\n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "value": "#include <vector>\n#include <numeric>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<int> v(10);\n    std::iota(v.begin(), v.end(), 1);\n    return std::accumulate(v.begin(), v.end(), 0) == 55 ? 0 : 1;\n}\n",
      "metadata": {
        "role": "file",
        "filename": "main.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
